ate History Table/row|V1.1|* Blood Potion buffed to heal 10% -> 25%.}}\n{{Update History Table/row|Weekly 54|* Fixed issue where Blood Potion wouldn't heal the player if used immediately after combat.}}\n{{Update History Table/row|Weekly 24|* New Uncommon Potion: Blood Potion (Ironclad Only)}}\n{{Update History Table/end}}\n\n{{PotionNav}}\n\n[[Category:Potions]] [[Category:ToUpdate]]"}}}]},"11689":{"pageid":11689,"ns":0,"title":"Bottled Miracle","revisions":[{"revid":54849,"parentid":54848,"slots":{"main":{"contentmodel":"wikitext","contentformat":"text/x-wiki","*":"{{Potion Infobox\n|Name=\t\t\tBottled Miracle\n|Sequel=\t\t1\n|Image=\t\t\tBottledMiracle.png\n|Rarity=\t\tCommon\n|Character=\t\tWatcher\n|Description=\tAdd (2;4) {{C|Miracle|Miracles}} to your hand.\n}}\n{{Small Card Infobox|Miracle}}\n{{P|Bottled Miracle}} is a {{QueryLink|Potions|character:Watcher|Watcher-exclusive}} {{QueryLink|Potions|rarity:Common|Common}} [[Potion]].\n\n== Sources ==\n{{Standard Potion Sources}}\n\n== Interactions ==\n=== Synergies ===\n* {{R|Sacred Bark}} doubles the effect of Bottled Miracle.\n<!-- Include any relevant synergies here, with bullet points. Otherwise delete this section entirely. -->\n<!-- Whenever a different relic is mentioned, use {{R|Relic Name}} to have its tooltip show up. \n* Cards with {{C|Card Name}}\n* Potions with {{P|Potion Name}}\n* Events with {{E|Event Name}}\n\nFor showing ascension changes, use {{Asc|the ascension number|Label}}, example, 5 or {{Asc|15|3}} Apparitions\n-->\n\n=== Neutral ===\n<!-- Include any interactions here that don't fit either in synergy or antisynergy. Otherwise delete this section entirely. Interactions are just any game mechanic that is not necessarily positive or necessarily negative, that doesn't fall in either of the above. -->\n\n=== Anti-Synergies ===\n<!-- Include any relevant anti-synergies here, with bullet points. Otherwise delete this section entirely. -->\n\n== Bugs ==\n<!-- Include any relevant bugs here. Othe