rivia you add here!\n\nDo not add subjective opinion here like \"xyz potion is considered bad\".\n-->\n\n== Update History ==\n{{Update History Table/start}}\n{{Update History Table/row|Weekly 25|* Regen potion gets an overhaul. It now acts like Poison, but heals.}}\n{{Update History Table/row|Weekly 24|* All potions that were in the game before this patch are Common.\n* Except Regen and Ancient potion, which are now Uncommon.}}\n{{Update History Table/row|Weekly 4|* Added a period at the end of Regen potion's description.}}\n{{Update History Table/row|?|* Added Regen Potion to the game}}\n{{Update History Table/end}}\n\n{{PotionNav}}\n\n[[Category:Potions]] [[Category:ToUpdate]]"}}}]},"11682":{"pageid":11682,"ns":0,"title":"Speed Potion","revisions":[{"revid":55951,"parentid":55029,"slots":{"main":{"contentmodel":"wikitext","contentformat":"text/x-wiki","*":"{{Sequel Disambiguation}} {{Potion Infobox\n|Name=\t\t\tSpeed Potion\n|Sequel=\t\t1\n|Image=\t\t\tSpeedPotion.png\n|Rarity=\t\tCommon\n|Description=\tGain (5;10) {{BD|Dexterity}}. At the end of your turn, lose (5;10) {{BD|Dexterity}}.\n}}\n{{Power Infobox|Dexterity}} {{Power Infobox|Dexterity Down}}\n{{P|Speed Potion}} is a {{QueryLink|Potions|rarity:Common|Common}} [[Potion]].\n\n== Sources ==\n{{Standard Potion Sources}}\n\n== Interactions ==\n=== Synergies ===\n* {{R|Sacred Bark}} doubles the effect of Speed Potion.\n<!-- Include any relevant synergies here, with bullet points. Otherwise delete this section entirely. -->\n<!-- Whenever a different relic is mentioned, use {{R|Relic Name}} to have its tooltip show up. \n* Cards with {{C|Card Name}}\n* Potions with {{P|Potion Name}}\n* Events with {{E|Event Name}}\n\nFor showing ascension changes, use {{Asc|the ascension number|Label}}, example, 5 or {{Asc|15|3}} Apparitions\n-->\n\n=== Neutral ===\n<!-- Include any interactions here that don't fit either in synergy or antisynergy. Otherwise delete this section entirely. Interactions are just any game mechanic 